                  "fill": "$text-3",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Unbounded is for short headings and big numbers, at 16 px and up only: it is wide and rounded, in tune with the logo, and loses legibility below that. Timers and small numbers use Plus Jakarta Sans with tabular figures, so digits do not shift as they change. Plus Jakarta Sans replaces Inter for UI: warmer, rounded terminals, made in Indonesia. Poppins is only for the GACHARD wordmark, loaded as one weight with Latin letters only (about 8 KB).",
