                  "fill": "$text-3",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 900,
                  "content": "Public page, opened from the QR on a printed card without signing in. Scan is a consumer page, so it carries no blockchain terms, token numbers or transaction links (ADR-002); chain details live only on Wallet, for people who ask for them. The owner appears by public name or collector label, never a username or wallet address (ADR-032). The redeem code itself never appears, only whether it is active.",
